  introLines:
  - speaker: 
    text: "M\u1ED9t bu\u1ED5i chi\u1EC1u, \u1EDF \u0111\u1EA7u m\u1ED9t con ph\u1ED1
      nh\u1ECF c\xF2n v\u1EAFng v\u1EBB..."
  - speaker: player
    text: "Xin ch\xE0o! M\xECnh sinh ra \u1EDF Vi\u1EC7t Nam, l\u1EDBn l\xEAn gi\u1EEFa
      m\xF9i b\xE1nh ch\u01B0ng ng\xE0y T\u1EBFt v\xE0 ti\u1EBFng rao ngo\xE0i ch\u1EE3."
  - speaker: player
    text: "L\u1EDBn h\u01A1n m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt, m\xECnh \u0111eo ba l\xF4 chu du kh\u1EAFp
      \u0111\u1EA5t n\u01B0\u1EDBc: t\u1EEB ph\u1ED1 c\u1ED5 H\xE0 N\u1ED9i, ph\u1ED1
      H\u1ED9i An t\u1EDBi ch\u1EE3 n\u1ED5i mi\u1EC1n T\xE2y."
  - speaker: player
    text: "R\u1ED3i m\xECnh c\xF3 c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i sang H\xE0n Qu\u1ED1c l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c.
      \u1EDE \u0111\xF3 m\xECnh m\xEA tteokbokki, kimbap v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng khu ch\u1EE3
      \u0111\xEAm r\u1ED9n r\xE0ng."
  - speaker: player
    text: "Gi\u1EDD m\xECnh tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1 Vi\u1EC7t Nam, mang theo t\xECnh y\xEAu
      v\u1EDBi v\u0103n ho\xE1 c\u1EE7a c\u1EA3 hai \u0111\u1EA5t n\u01B0\u1EDBc."
  - speaker: player
    text: "M\xECnh mu\u1ED1n m\u1EDF m\u1ED9t h\u1ED9i ch\u1EE3, n\u01A1i v\u0103n
      ho\xE1 Vi\u1EC7t Nam v\xE0 H\xE0n Qu\u1ED1c g\u1EB7p nhau!"
  - speaker: player
    text: "Ch\xE0o b\xE1c Tr\u01B0\u1EDFng ph\u1ED1! Ch\xE1u xin ph\xE9p \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      m\u1EDF m\u1ED9t h\u1ED9i ch\u1EE3 v\u0103n ho\xE1 Vi\u1EC7t - H\xE0n \u1EDF
      con ph\u1ED1 n\xE0y \u1EA1."
  - speaker: mayor
    text: "H\u1ED9i ch\u1EE3 Vi\u1EC7t - H\xE0n \xE0? Nghe hay \u0111\u1EA5y! Con
      ph\u1ED1 n\xE0y v\u1EAFng v\u1EBB l\xE2u r\u1ED3i, c\xF3 h\u1ED9i ch\u1EE3
      th\xEC vui bi\u1EBFt m\u1EA5y."
  - speaker: mayor
    text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c, b\xE1c \u0111\u1ED3ng \xFD! \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 gi\u1EA5y
      ph\xE9p m\u1EDF h\u1ED9i ch\u1EE3 c\u1EE7a ch\xE1u."
  - speaker: mayor
    text: "Ch\xE1u c\xF3 500 xu, \u0111\u1EE7 d\u1EF1ng qu\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn.
      C\u1EE9 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u t\u1EEB t\u1EEB r\u1ED3i ph\xE1t tri\u1EC3n
      c\u1EA3 khu ph\u1ED1 nh\xE9!"
  - speaker: player
    text: "C\u1EA3m \u01A1n b\xE1c! H\u1ED9i ch\u1EE3 Vi\u1EC7t - H\xE0n, b\u1EAFt
      \u0111\u1EA7u th\xF4i!"
